# SHELL: no text in the console's screens runs out of its panel or over
# other text. Every text element reports its box to the layout audit as it
# is drawn; each *_layout query draws a screen with the audit on and counts
# the boxes that stick out of their panel, overlap each other, or hold a
# character the font can't draw (each one is printed). The library's info
# panel is checked with the cursor on every slot, with each of its goals.
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 30
expect_scene library
expect library_cursor == 0
# row 1
expect library_cursor == 0
expect library_layout == 0
press RIGHT
expect library_cursor == 1
expect library_layout == 0
press RIGHT
